; POOL EXTENSION (sl-0200): THE CAROUSEL — a slow heavy ring with a
; 108° authored gap; ROTOR precession (1.1°/tick) walks the gap
; around the room, so the escape window is always somewhere and
; always MOVING. Room-pattern language: the ring fills the room
; regardless of the player. Pattern id 38; lead 36 (the radial
; danger class). Elite amber placeholder; identity data-keyed for
; the designer's fish re-skin.

